#~ msgid ""
#~ "A blur effect that smoothly blends pixels within a given radius. This "
#~ "effect is more precise, but way less optimized."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "주어진 반경 내에서 픽셀을 매끄럽게 혼합하는 블러 효과. 더 정밀하지만 최적"
#~ "화가 덜 되어 있습니다."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The intensity of the blur effect. The bigger it is, the slower it will be."
